  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Case-I</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>then it is false if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is false.</p><p>So not a tautology</p><p>Case-II</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo></math>&nbsp;tautology</p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>Case-III</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo></math></p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not a tautology</p><p>when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>Case-IV</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not a tautology</p>"
